The extension bundles pagemd and pagemd-common (Apache-2.0, same authors) and
third-party packages; apps/vscode/ThirdPartyNotices.txt lists each one with its
licence text, including the Inter typeface (SIL Open Font License 1.1) that
pagemd-common's book-fonts.css embeds.

The UOFO ("Uncertified Organic Farmers Org") name and logo in the test
fixtures are invented placeholders, not a real organisation.
